From: Filippo Falezza <filippo.falezza@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 19:38:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 121/159] remoteproc: qcom: pas: Add SM7250 ADSP and CDSP

The audio and compute DSPs of SM7250 are loaded through the same
TrustZone PAS interface, with the same power domains and memory
layout, as on SM8250. Add compatibles for them using the SM8250
resources.

On the Moto G 5G Plus the ADSP boots this way (with the adsp2 image
selected by the adsp_variant fuse). The CDSP image currently fails
authentication with -EINVAL.

This patch was generated by an AI coding assistant (Claude Opus 5.5 in
Claude Code) during an interactive bring-up session on a Motorola Moto G
5G Plus (XT2075-3, "nairo"). It has not yet been reviewed line by line
by a human and needs that review before any submission.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Filippo Falezza <filippo.falezza@outlook.com>
---
 drivers/remoteproc/qcom_q6v5_pas.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/remoteproc/qcom_q6v5_pas.c b/drivers/remoteproc/qcom_q6v5_pas.c
index d0638eac76bb..88b4e252080b 100644
--- a/drivers/remoteproc/qcom_q6v5_pas.c
+++ b/drivers/remoteproc/qcom_q6v5_pas.c
@@ -2043,6 +2043,8 @@ static const struct of_device_id qcom_pas_of_match[] = {
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm6350-adsp-pas", .data = &sm6350_adsp_resource },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm6350-cdsp-pas", .data = &sm6350_cdsp_resource },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm6350-mpss-pas", .data = &mpss_resource_init },
+	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm7250-adsp-pas", .data = &sm8250_adsp_resource },
+	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm7250-cdsp-pas", .data = &sm8250_cdsp_resource },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm7250-mpss-pas", .data = &mpss_resource_init },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm6375-adsp-pas", .data = &sm6350_adsp_resource },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm6375-cdsp-pas", .data = &sm8150_cdsp_resource },
